    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 2360,
      "height": 50,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "06 · 风险资金未归集与已归集：控制范围和闭环",
      "fontSize": 34,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:45.136Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:45.136Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-subtitle",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 94,
      "width": 2360,
      "height": 44,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "风险裁定来自后端案件与有效审批（规划）；合约只执行控制 · 冻结状态以最终链事实为准",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:45.136Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:45.136Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-06-risk-isolation-zone-0",
      "type": "rectangle",
